            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband loves it. I made it yesterday. It is very delicious. Next to make I will try less 1 cup sugar as the gelatin have sweet in it. But it is very very good jam.",
            "datePublished": "2020-07-02T20:14:51.297Z"
