              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tsdraisey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Amazing!!! This was my first time making jam and canning and everything turned out perfect! I made this as gifts for my bridal shower and it was a big hit! I followed the recipe exactly for one batch and cut back on sugar for the second. Both were Amazing and the color is absolutely beautiful on toast! Next time I might try some with apple or blueberry or both! Thank you for sharing!",
